<view class="orders">
  <view class="orders__hero">
    <text class="orders__kicker">ORDER CENTER · 订单中心</text>
    <text class="orders__title">订单中心</text>
    <text class="orders__copy">本页汇总你在本小程序内的全部资金交易记录，包含待支付、已支付与退款状态。支付结果以服务端核验的微信平台通知为准。</text>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{needLogin}}" class="orders-gate">
    <text class="orders-gate__title">登录后查看订单</text>
    <text class="orders-gate__copy">订单与微信账号绑定。登录成功后停留在本页，不会跳转其他页面。</text>
    <button class="btn btn--primary" loading="{{loginBusy}}" bindtap="login">微信一键登录</button>
  </view>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="orders__summary">
      <text class="orders__count">共 {{orderCount}} 笔订单</text>
      <text class="orders__hint" wx:if="{{orderCount}}">点任一订单查看支付状态与报告</text>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="orders-empty">
      <text class="orders-empty__title">正在读取订单…</text>
    </view>

    <view wx:elif="{{!orderCount}}" class="orders-empty">
      <text class="orders-empty__mark" aria-hidden="true">◇</text>
      <text class="orders-empty__title">暂无订单记录</text>
      <text class="orders-empty__copy">完成学生问卷后，可自主选择是否付款解锁完整成长报告。付款前不展示报告结论。</text>
      <button class="btn btn--outline" bindtap="goCompass">去教育罗盘</button>
    </view>

    <view wx:else class="orders-list">
      <view
        wx:for="{{orders}}"
        wx:key="orderId"
        class="orders-item"
        role="button"
        aria-label="{{item.productLabel}} {{item.statusLabel}}"
        data-id="{{item.orderId}}"
        bindtap="openOrder"
      >
        <view class="orders-item__head">
          <text class="orders-item__title">{{item.productLabel}}</text>
          <text class="orders-item__status orders-item__status--{{item.statusTone}}">{{item.statusLabel}}</text>
        </view>
        <text class="orders-item__meta">{{item.metaLabel}}</text>
        <view class="orders-item__foot">
          <text class="orders-item__amount">{{item.amountLabel}}</text>
          <text class="orders-item__chevron" aria-hidden="true">›</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <button class="btn btn--text orders__help" open-type="contact">订单有问题？联系客服</button>
    <text class="orders__foot">订单记录按法规留存；退款由客服人工受理，不提供自助退款。</text>
  </block>
</view>
